WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.100
- Our special teacher appreciation
hour might almost be over

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.090
but appreciation of teachers
in general will never be over.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.520
I have one more story to share,

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.960
I hope that you'll love as much as I do.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.539
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:10.539 --> 00:00:13.630
(audience applauds)

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.600
So we talked all hour about how generous

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.660
and life-changing teachers can be.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.440
But sometimes students step
up in big ways as well.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.600
Case in point, last year Vinod Menon,

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.480
a physics professor at City
College of New York in Harlem

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.387
got an anonymous box filled with cash,

00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:30.563
$180,000 to be precise.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.900
After checking with the
administration box full of money,

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.250
its like amazing.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.910
After checking with the
administration and police,

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.680
they determined it was a very real

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.970
and very legal donation to the school.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:46.550
Super crazy, professor Menon
is on the line right now.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.880
What's a professor.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.332
How are you doing?

00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:50.940
(crowd cheering)

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.270
- Hey Kelly, how are you?

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.990
- I am so good.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:54.890
You are better.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.600
'Cause this is crazy.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.840
So the box apparently had
been sitting there for months,

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.290
right in the mail room.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.650
- That's right.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.970
The box arrived in November, 2020,

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:07.393
and I got the box in September, 2021.

00:01:07.393 --> 00:01:09.930
When I went back in person teaching,

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.240
because this box had come to a room

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.410
that I normally don't go to check my mail.

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:18.830
And yes, I saw the box,
the box looked heavy.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:19.663
I opened it.

00:01:19.663 --> 00:01:21.010
There was a letter in there saying

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.700
that this is a donation to the department

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:25.460
for the wonderful education
that the person received,

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.250
and they in physics department,

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.510
and they went on to do very
well in science later in life,

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:36.350
and want to give back to the
college, to support students.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.140
And then I looked on under the letter

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.290
and there was this tax
of cash staring at me.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.210
First I thought somebody
was playing a prank on me.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:46.240
I touched the cash to
make sure it was all real,

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.150
and it was.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.410
And so I called up the
Dean, and she came down

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:51.230
we looked at the cash together,

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:53.009
and Lo and behold,

00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:55.383
there was $180,000 sitting in there.

00:01:55.383 --> 00:01:57.770
So we called the security,

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:58.730
the police got involve,

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:01.630
the FBI got involved to
make sure it was all clean,

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:02.900
and about two months later

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.480
we were informed that
it's all clean money.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:06.280
So now we are going to be awarding

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.244
two students scholarships.

00:02:08.244 --> 00:02:09.661
- That's amazing.

00:02:11.104 --> 00:02:14.710
So do you have any idea who sent it?

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:17.220
- No, no clue at all.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.053
We don't know who it is,

00:02:18.053 --> 00:02:19.730
we've had a few people who
reached out to us saying

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.370
that they probably
know, but no clear lead,

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.660
and you know the person
wanted to keep it anonymous

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:26.750
and I respect that.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.340
All I wanna say is thank you,

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:31.030
and we are glad we were able
to give the kind of education

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:33.420
that we gave to him or her,

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.970
and we are hoping that we
are continuing that tradition

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.140
here at City College.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.840
- Thank you so much Professor Menon.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:41.146
I'm liking your posts right now.

00:02:41.146 --> 00:02:43.710
(audience claps)

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:44.543
And that's not all,

00:02:44.543 --> 00:02:46.820
our season long partner
Pilate Pinmakers of Friction

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.800
to go to the Kelly Clarkson show.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.650
Wanna celebrate those creating fearlessly,

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:51.590
just like you, Sir.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:53.130
So they're gonna write you a cheque,

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.844
not cash, for a thousand dollars.

00:02:55.844 --> 00:02:58.080
(crowd cheering)

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.543
And you can keep this one.

